 **Parameters**
-*   $\mathbf{s}_q$: Query diagonal scales. Typical values depend on the scene scale and query resolution.
-*   $\mathbf{B}_e$: Bounded coefficients. Values are constrained to $[-1, 1]$ during optimization or clamping.
